# Production site build settings that are public flags, not secrets (never put a secret here: this file is committed).
# Cloudflare Pages runs `npm run build` (mode production), so Vite reads this file; a Pages dashboard variable of the same name would win.
# MPC-8731: learning events ON (site switch; the Worker switch is LEARNING_EVENTS_ENABLED in workers/webhook-receiver/wrangler.toml).
# Rollback: set to "false" (or remove the line) and let Pages rebuild.
VITE_LEARNING_EVENTS=true
